**Root cause:** `discountTotal()` in `src/checkout.ts` computed `raw - discount` without any lower bound. When the discount (e.g. 30) exceeded the item total (e.g. 20), the function returned a negative value (−10).

**Fix (line 6):**
```ts
// before
return raw - discount;

// after
return Math.max(0, raw - discount);
